      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Pokémon Road is a downhill path leading to sea.\\c\\nYou should try having a nice little hike along it\\nwith your favorite Pokémon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_r016g0101_guard_01",
      "hash": "257f5a13f4cc53cd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There are certain Pokémon that will fly while\\ncarrying their Trainer on their back.\\c\\nBecause Pokémon Road is so wide and safe, it’s\\npossible to fly particularly freely there, too."
